[{"id":"fm-core1-1.22-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>Sketch each of the following curves, labelled each intersection with the axes clearly.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{x^2}9+\\dfrac{y^2}{25}=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{x^2}{16}+\\dfrac{y^2}4=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{x^2}2+\\dfrac{y^2}5=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^2+9y^2=36\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^2+5y^2=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{x^2}{a^2}+\\dfrac{y^2}{b^2}=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for constants <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a&gt;b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{x^2}{a^2}+\\dfrac{y^2}{b^2}=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for constants <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a&lt;b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{x^2}{a^2}+\\dfrac{y^2}{b^2}=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for constants <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.22/solutions/assets/diagrams/122-p1-1.png\" 