3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{x^2}5+\\frac{y^2}3=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\sqrt5,0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-\\sqrt5,0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-\\sqrt5\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\sqrt5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{x^2}3+\\frac{y^2}5=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\sqrt3,0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-\\sqrt3,0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-\\sqrt3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\sqrt3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.22-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>Each of the following curves are of the form</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{x^2}{a^2}+\\frac{y^2}{b^2}=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are constants. In each case find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.22/questions/assets/diagrams/122-q3a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.22/questions/assets/diagrams/122-q3b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.22/questions/assets/diagrams/122-q3c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2,0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> gives <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,4)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> gives <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(3,0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> gives <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> gives <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\sqrt7,0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> gives <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=\\sqrt7\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,\\sqrt3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> gives <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=\\sqrt3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=\\sqrt7\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=\\sqrt3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.22-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>For constants <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, an ellipse is given by</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{x^2}a+\\frac{y^2}b=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>It passes through <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P(1,0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Q(0,-2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>State the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>Sketch the curve including labelling any intersections with the axes.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1a=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac4b=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore a=1\\text{ and }b=4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.22/solutions/assets/diagrams/122-p4-1.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.22-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>For constants <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, an ellipse is given by</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{x^2}a+\\frac{y^2}b=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>It passes through <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P(-\\sqrt6,0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Q(0,3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>State the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>Sketch the curve including labelling any intersections with the axes.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac6a=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac9b=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore a=6\\text{ and }b=9\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.22/solutions/assets/diagrams/122-p5-1.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.22-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>For constants <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, an ellipse is given by</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{x^2}a+\\frac{y^2}b=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>It passes through <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P(2,\\sqrt6)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Q(\\sqrt6,-\\sqrt3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>State the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>Sketch the curve including labelling any intersections with the axes.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac4a+\\frac6b=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac6a+\\frac3b=1\\Rightarrow\\frac{12}a+\\frac6b=2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which gives</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac4a+(2-\\frac{12}a)=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1=\\frac8a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac48+\\frac6b=1\\Rightarrow\\frac b6=2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore a=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=12\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.22/solutions/assets/diagrams/122-p5-2.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.22-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>For a constant <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, an ellipse is given by</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{x^2}a+\\frac{y^2}{2a}=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the points of intersection of the curve with the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis.</p></li><li><p>Find the points of intersection of the curve with the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis.</p></li><li><p>Sketch the curve including labelling any intersections with the axes in terms of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>Given the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2,-\\sqrt{10})\" data-display=\"false\"></span> lies in the curve, find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^2=a\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore(-\\sqrt a,0)\\text{ and }(\\sqrt a,0)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y^2=2a\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore(0,-\\sqrt{2a})\\text{ and }(0,\\sqrt{2a})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.22/solutions/assets/diagrams/122-p6-1.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac4a+\\frac{10}{2a}=1\\Rightarrow\\frac9a=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore a=9\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]}]